  <!--
    Deleting a person row lets the database clean up everything referencing the person: data owned by the person
    (and the data hanging off it, like comments of the person's applications) is deleted, references to the person
    on data of others (applier, boss, canceller, comment author) are set to null. The recreated constraints get
    readable names.
  -->
